      "body": "Thanks for reporting this.\n\nI’ll investigate the following:\n- Proper handling of HAT_X / HAT_Y D-Pad input.\n- Mapping both positive and negative axis directions independently (Up/Down/Left/Right).\n- Fixing automap so Android/Xbox-style controllers don’t map the D-Pad to unrelated inputs.\n- Making sure the resulting mappings are correctly forwarded to the emulated PS4 controller.",
